        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>MNG 196, Modern Savannah Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Savanna Cabinet Pull is modern hardware at its most stylish. If you are looking for an affordable way to upgrade your kitchen, the MNG Savanna Collection has your back. This stylish cabinet hardware is available in satin nickel or polished chrome. Choose from 3 sizes. Each Modern Savannah Cabinet Pull comes packaged with mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the MNG Savanna Collection:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Base Material: Aluminum </li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1\" long #8-32 screws and 1-1/2\"  long #8-32 screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Lengths:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>MNG 196</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 8-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>MNG 197</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 6-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 9-2/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>MNG 198</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 7-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 10-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i> \r\n</p>",
